    questions: ["What accusations (guilt, shame, “you'll never change”) does the enemy most often raise against you?", "Revelation 12:11 names three things: the blood, testimony, and not loving life unto death. Why might all three belong together?", "What does it mean in practice to “aim” the blood rather than use the phrase as a formula?"],
