    background: "Study expansion: The sermon's prayer brings the three weapons into one act of faith. Historically, Christian prayers of protection have a long tradition, such as the ancient “Lorica” (breastplate) prayers like St. Patrick's Breastplate, which ask for Christ's covering over every part of life. That is similar to the sermon's “over my mind, my home, my children.”",
