window.TRANSCRIPT=[{"t": 0.5, "text": "The Holy Spirit led you to this message."}, {"t": 4.1, "text": "This is a secret you will wish you learned sooner."}, {"t": 8.2, "text": "So most believers know they have spiritual weapons."}, {"t": 13.9, "text": "Very few of them know how to actually use them."}, {"t": 18.3, "text": "You can quote Ephesians 6."}, {"t": 21.2, "text": "You can sing the songs."}, {"t": 22.9, "text": "You can plead the blood in your prayers."}, {"t": 26.7, "text": "But if you've never been trained to take aim, you're a warrior waving a sword in the air"}, {"t": 33.6, "text": "while the real battle goes on right past you."}, {"t": 37.5, "text": "Today, I want to put a weapon in your hand and show you how to use it with precision."}, {"t": 45.4, "text": "Stay with me."}, {"t": 47.1, "text": "Listen, before I go any further, I want to be upfront with you."}, {"t": 52.5, "text": "What I'm about to share is the heart of week 5 of our 12-week believers authority intensive"}, {"t": 59.3, "text": "masterclass over at holyluia.org."}, {"t": 63.0, "text": "I won't give you the entire week in this one video, it would take hours."}, {"t": 69.1, "text": "But I am going to give you enough today that by the time we pray together in this message,"}, {"t": 76.1, "text": "something in the spirit realm is going to shift."}, {"t": 80.9, "text": "Do you remember in 2 Corinthians 10-3-5, Paul wrote,"}, {"t": 87.1, "text": "The weapons we fight with are not the weapons of the world."}, {"t": 91.5, "text": "On the contrary, they have divine power to demolish strongholds."}, {"t": 97.8, "text": "Notice what Paul said, divine power to demolish strongholds."}, {"t": 103.1, "text": "Not symbolic, not emotional, not religious."}, {"t": 107.8, "text": "Divine power, real impact, actual demolition."}, {"t": 112.3, "text": "In Ephesians 6 verse 12, Paul tells us who the real enemy is."}, {"t": 117.4, "text": "Our struggle is not against flesh and blood, but against the rulers, against the authorities,"}, {"t": 123.5, "text": "against the powers of this dark world."}, {"t": 126.8, "text": "Your enemy is not your spouse, it's not your boss, it's not your in-laws, it's"}, {"t": 133.2, "text": "not the person at church who hurts you."}, {"t": 136.4, "text": "Your enemy is a spiritual entity in a spiritual realm, and until you fight the right battle"}, {"t": 143.9, "text": "in the right realm with the right weapons, you'll kick swinging at people and wondering"}, {"t": 151.8, "text": "why nothing changes in your life."}, {"t": 154.8, "text": "So let me hand you three weapons today, just three."}, {"t": 159.7, "text": "The full week covers five, but three is enough to change your atmosphere here today."}, {"t": 166.3, "text": "Step number one, the blood of Jesus."}, {"t": 170.8, "text": "Revelation 12 verse 11, they triumphed over him by the blood of the Lamb and the word"}, {"t": 176.1, "text": "of their testimony."}, {"t": 179.0, "text": "The blood is not a religious phrase."}, {"t": 182.8, "text": "The blood is a legal weapon in the courtroom of heaven."}, {"t": 188.1, "text": "When you apply the blood, you're not asking."}, {"t": 192.0, "text": "You are declaring every accusation the enemy has against you is silenced by the blood of"}, {"t": 199.5, "text": "Jesus."}, {"t": 200.5, "text": "Don't just say, I plead the blood, aim it."}, {"t": 206.2, "text": "I applied the blood of Jesus over my mind."}, {"t": 210.0, "text": "Every lying thought is silenced."}, {"t": 212.6, "text": "I apply the blood of Jesus over my home."}, {"t": 216.3, "text": "No unclean spirit is permitted to dwell here."}, {"t": 220.8, "text": "I apply the blood of Jesus over my children, my marriage, my finances."}, {"t": 226.3, "text": "We are covered, protected and sealed in Jesus name."}, {"t": 231.7, "text": "Weapon number two, the name of Jesus."}, {"t": 234.8, "text": "Philippians 2 verse 10, at the name of Jesus every knee shall bow in heaven and on"}, {"t": 241.1, "text": "earth and under the earth."}, {"t": 244.1, "text": "Every knee in every realm, including the demonic."}, {"t": 249.5, "text": "The name is not a magic word, it's a power of attorney."}, {"t": 254.7, "text": "When you speak the name, you are acting on Jesus' behalf with his authority."}, {"t": 260.7, "text": "So stop being vague, be specific."}, {"t": 264.6, "text": "In the name of Jesus, I command the spirit of fear to leave my body."}, {"t": 270.0, "text": "In the name of Jesus, I command and the spirit of insomnia to release my sleep."}, {"t": 276.9, "text": "In the name of Jesus, I command the spirit of confusion to come up and out of my mind."}, {"t": 284.4, "text": "You are not begging, you're not negotiating, you are commanding with delegation and authority"}, {"t": 292.4, "text": "from the King of Kings."}, {"t": 295.3, "text": "Weapon number three, praise."}, {"t": 298.2, "text": "Second Chronicles chapter 20, King Jehoshaphat is surrounded by three armies."}, {"t": 303.3, "text": "He sends the worshipper out ahead of the soldiers."}, {"t": 307.8, "text": "And the Bible says, as they began to sing in praise, the Lord set ambushes against the"}, {"t": 314.5, "text": "man who were invading Judah and they were defeated."}, {"t": 321.1, "text": "Praise was not the warm-up, praise was the weapon."}, {"t": 326.0, "text": "There are some battles you will not pray your way through."}, {"t": 331.4, "text": "You will not strategize your way through."}, {"t": 334.8, "text": "You will not argue your way through."}, {"t": 338.4, "text": "You will worship your way through."}, {"t": 341.8, "text": "Now listen, wherever you are right now, at work, in the car, lying in bed, pray this"}, {"t": 349.4, "text": "with me out loud."}, {"t": 351.2, "text": "Father, in the name of Jesus, I take up the weapons you have given me."}, {"t": 357.9, "text": "I am not defenseless."}, {"t": 359.6, "text": "I am not powerless."}, {"t": 361.1, "text": "I am not a victim."}, {"t": 363.6, "text": "I plead the blood of Jesus over my life, my mind, my body, my home and my family."}, {"t": 372.2, "text": "Every accusation of the enemy against me is silenced right now in Jesus' name."}, {"t": 378.3, "text": "I declare the name of Jesus over every battle I'm facing."}, {"t": 383.4, "text": "Every spirit of fear, every spirit of infirmity, every spirit of poverty, every spirit of"}, {"t": 390.0, "text": "confusion, I command you to bow at the authority of Jesus Christ and leave my life now."}, {"t": 397.9, "text": "I lift up praise as a weapon."}, {"t": 400.3, "text": "I praise you in the storm."}, {"t": 402.2, "text": "I praise you before I see the breakthrough because I know my praise releases your power"}, {"t": 408.2, "text": "on my behalf."}, {"t": 410.0, "text": "In Jesus' mighty name, amen."}, {"t": 414.7, "text": "Something just shifted."}, {"t": 415.7, "text": "I felt it."}, {"t": 417.9, "text": "If this stirred something in you, I want you to know this was just the surface."}, {"t": 424.9, "text": "Inside the 12-week Believer's Authority intensive at hallelujah.org masterclass, Week 5 walks"}, {"t": 431.9, "text": "you through all five spiritual weapons, the blood, the name, the word, praise and fasting"}, {"t": 439.2, "text": "with the deep teaching, the targeted prayers and the practical assignments that turn"}, {"t": 445.7, "text": "this from a Sunday morning concept into a daily way of life."}, {"t": 452.4, "text": "You also get the printable workbook for each week, the audio version and a quiet community"}, {"t": 459.5, "text": "of believers walking through it alongside you."}, {"t": 463.3, "text": "Listen, wherever you are today, you have a sword in your hand."}, {"t": 468.1, "text": "You're not a spectator in this war."}, {"t": 471.6, "text": "You're a trained soldier in the army of the living God."}, {"t": 476.6, "text": "Pick up your weapons and use them."}, {"t": 478.5, "text": "Listen, I'll see you in the next video."}, {"t": 481.0, "text": "I love you."}, {"t": 482.6, "text": "God loves you so much more."}, {"t": 485.5, "text": "God bless you today."}];
window.VIDEO_ID="865569085938022";
